Comment: This package is AGPL-3.0-or-later while the rest of this repository
 is Apache-2.0. The module is a proxmod extension: it subclasses
 PVE::RESTHandler and is loaded into pvedaemon, both AGPL, and registers
 through proxmod's own AGPL extension API. It is licensed to match what it
 links against rather than the repository default. Nothing else in this
 repository links against it -- the Go client only speaks to it over HTTP.

